SUMMARY:Special Event: Julia Leahy & Connor Willey: The Locked In Tour
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 2031 Sansom Street\, Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:The Locked In Tour with Julia Leahy and Connor Willey is a merg
 ing of what many are calling “the greatest minds of a generation.” Afte
 r years of being compared to one another\, tagged in each other's posts\, a
 nd told they are the male and female versions of themselves\, Julia and Con
 nor decided to unite. The world changed that day. A tectonic shift\, a palp
 able electricity in the air. Connor\, an incredibly tall and powerful athle
 te from Orange County California\, grew up waiting to perform. He first tho
 ught he would be performing under the lights of an arena in the NBA\, until
  he realized it was statistically impossible for a 5’6 white guy. He now 
 lives in LA\, doing comedy\, content\, and stand up full time. Julia\, a sk
 illed assassin whose weapon of choice is her words. Hailing from the great 
 city of Rochester New York\, Julia dreamed of being a Broadway star with a 
 great butt. She now spends her days in NYC growing both her comedy career a
 nd her less-than-great butt. A prolific storyteller and theatrical wordsmit
 h\, combined with the raw physical power of her male counterpart\, make for
  a hilarious duo that are\, in fact\, locked in.\n\nCouple's Package includ
 es:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- 
 Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent c
 ustomers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous t
 o other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/spe
 cial-event-julia-leahy-connor-willey-the-locked-in-tour/
